{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chengguo-e-p104","title":"济难郑玄祭法之注","accounts":[{"id":"chengguo-a-d309032cedd636137f0c","label":"裴注·注家按语","text":"济难郑玄祭法之注","evidence":["chengguo-q-d716fae3a75050ab7cd6"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0009","role":"难郑玄注《祭法》云有虞以上尚德褅郊祖宗配用有德、夫虬龙神于獭獭自祭其先不祭虬龙也、骐驎白虎仁于豺豺自祭其先、如玄之说有虞以上豺獭之不若邪","evidence":["chengguo-q-d716fae3a75050ab7cd6"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chengguo-q-d716fae3a75050ab7cd6"]},"ordering_evidence":"chengguo-q-d716fae3a75050ab7cd6","source_order":[14,471,212],"order":3175}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0009","name":"蒋济","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-d716fae3a75050ab7cd6","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-54b15c045a826683ae92","layer":"pei","quote":"济又难郑玄注《祭法》云“有虞以上尚德，褅郊祖宗，配用有德；自夏以下，稍用其姓氏”。济曰：“夫虬龙神于獭，獭自祭其先，不祭虬龙也。骐驎、白虎仁于豺，豺自祭其先，不祭骐、虎也。如玄之说，有虞以上，豺、獭之不若邪？”","attribution":"正文","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":470,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-26b95a515c21fd6d9ab0","start":212,"end":317}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
